# Build context is the repo root (ADR-0003 step B). Send only what images need.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/reports
**/coverage
**/*.log
.git
.github
.claude
.githooks
docs
deploy
scripts
README.md
CLAUDE.md

# Secrets never enter a build context (docs/secrets.md)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
!**/*.env.example
**/*.tfvars
**/*.tfstate*

# The mobile app's sources aren't needed by any server image; its manifest is,
# because npm ci checks every workspace in the lockfile.
apps/*
!apps/*/package.json
